   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The internet runs on forms. Most of the websites you interact with are based on databases using forms for what you see. Look at a website you use frequently and identify which screens are likely forms that show you data from the underlying website database. Using the form you have identified, determine what the table(s) under it likely hold. Draw the table and explain your rationale, including a screen capture of the form you based your work on.",
